<title>USA: Iraq to seek 50,000 T wheat under UN Deal- trade.</title>
<headline>Iraq to seek 50,000 T wheat under UN Deal- trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq will seek 50,000 tonnes U.S. wheat on February 11 under the United Nations Food-for-Oil deal, several U.S. exporters said.  </p>
<p>One exporter said the wheat would be No. 2 hard red winter wheat. The tender would be divided into two lots of 25,000 tonnes each, one for April delivery and the other for May delivery.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
